{"synopsis":"Pemimpin Kultus Iblis, Seok Woncho, adalah monster yang bahkan melampaui Pemimpin Kultus Darah. Tahukah Anda siapa yang membunuhnya? “Ha Mu-baek.” “Tapi mengapa Anda mengungkitnya…?” “Karena dia datang ke Akademi Mengryong kita sebagai instruktur.” …Sialan. Kita celaka! Ha Mu-baek, seniman bela diri terhebat yang menghancurkan Kultus Iblis dan Kultus Darah, sekarang ditugaskan sebagai instruktur di akademi pelatihan seni bela diri karena perebutan kekuasaan politik. Bertekad untuk hidup tenang sambil menyembunyikan identitasnya, dia segera menemukan dirinya memecahkan masalah kadet dengan latar belakang yang menyayat hati, mendisiplinkan sampah manusia sampah di akademi, dan entah mengapa menjadi semakin sibuk dari hari ke hari… Selamat datang! Ini pertama kalinya Anda bertemu dengan instruktur jenius yang gila, bukan?!","alternative_title":"천하제일 무공교관","author":"Leoul, Singa","artist":"Seokbong","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b717c8dd-acd2-48d2-ae8c-74ce876ba6a5","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2025-07-26","released":"2025-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"397710e5-610d-4309-9986-5a010cf8d4da","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2025-07-19","released":"2025-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"c83aa8da-440c-440c-ba4d-a5ae25cd315d","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2025-07-16","released":"2025-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"49cee9a5-a49c-4bd0-a80f-e99f724ed52b","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2025-07-08","released":"2025-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"4dc356e7-34cc-4156-adb5-7c5149f03545","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2025-07-07","released":"2025-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"d064bdd6-7988-4eec-8274-11d43252e52a","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2025-07-07","released":"2025-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"4da1319b-c694-4944-8af3-e16f041a7b71","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2025-06-21","released":"2025-06-21"},{"chapter_id":"7687b00f-d457-465c-add7-200f598bb0c2","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":